# Cloudflare Pages redirects for hydractrl.d17e.dev.
#
# Routing needs no rules: Pages serves index.html (the landing page) at /,
# app.html (the interface) at /app and output.html at /output, and falls back
# to index.html for unknown paths because there is no 404.html.
#
# Never add a 200 rule that points at one of those .html files (for example
# "/output /output.html 200"): Pages answers /output.html with a redirect to
# /output, so the rule loops forever.
#
# Share links from before the landing page used the site root
# (/#sketch=...). Fragments never reach the server, so the landing page
# forwards those to /app itself.

/download /#download 302
